patrone-shell-config (0.2.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Give root Patrone's prompt too, in red. Root's account comes before the
    package, so /etc/skel never reached it, and a root shell from sudo su,
    sudo -i or su - showed Ubuntu's plain prompt, which Patrone Terminal
    draws in its pale blue text color. Installing the package now copies
    .bash_aliases and .zshrc (for sudo -s from zsh) to /root, unless root
    has them already.

 -- William Daugherty <31995458+billsecond@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 27 Oct 2026 10:00:00 -0500

